<title>UK: Stoddard Sekers H1 pretax loss widens.</title>
<headline>Stoddard Sekers H1 pretax loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>six months to September 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence) loss	 1.7		    vs 1.2</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 0.375		  vs 0.375</p>
<p> Pretax loss		0.9		    vs 0.6</p>
<p> Turnover		   26.2		   vs 25.9</p>
<p> Operating loss	   0.6		    vs 0.3</p>
<p> Pay date		   Jan 6, 1997</p>
<p>Div registration date  Dec 10</p>
<p>NOTE - UK floorings and carpets group Stoddard Sekers International Plc said that current order books are improving as market demand strengthens.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
